    <h1>BLDC Motor for Machinery Movers &amp; Equipment Transport</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">How to select BLDC drive motors for electric machinery movers — from 1-ton CNC machine skates to 50-ton heavy equipment transport platforms.</p>
  </div>
